<!--
  YCDO — SELECTION / APPOINTMENT LETTER
  Transcribed verbatim from the approved printed format (Letter No. 2455/YCDO/2026).

  NOTE 1: The "Notification — It is notified that following format for
  Appointment/Selection Letter is approved" block on the original scan is the
  internal memo APPROVING this format. It is deliberately NOT reproduced here —
  it must not appear on letters issued to employees.

  NOTE 2: Wording is preserved EXACTLY as approved, including known typos
  ("patty expenses", "medical raps", "will be proceed"). See the typo list
  supplied separately — do not silently correct an approved format.

  NOTE 3: Policy constants (03 months probation, 15%, four leaves, 30 days
  notice, Rs. 10,000 minimum fine, SOP sections 06/07/08/10) are literal text
  in this template on purpose. They do not vary per employee — change them by
  editing the template, not by passing variables.

  Rendering: Handlebars -> HTML -> Puppeteer PDF, A4, margins set in @page.
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 20mm 18mm 18mm 18mm; }

  body {
    font-family: "Times New Roman", "Liberation Serif", Times, Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 12.5pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .letterhead { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 14pt; }
  .letterhead img { max-height: 70px; }
  .letterhead .org { font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 4pt; }
  .letterhead .meta { font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .rule { border-bottom: 1.5px solid #000; margin: 8pt 0 14pt; }

  h1.title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 0 0 16pt;
  }

  .refrow {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 18pt;
  }

  .recipient { margin-bottom: 14pt; }
  .recipient div { margin-bottom: 3pt; }
  .recipient .label { font-weight: bold; }

  p { margin: 0 0 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 28pt; }
  p.noindent { text-indent: 0; }

  .grades {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    margin: 10pt 0 12pt;
  }

  h2.section {
    font-size: 12.5pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 14pt 0 8pt;
  }

  ol.terms { margin: 0; padding-left: 18pt; }
  ol.terms li { margin-bottom: 8pt; text-align: justify; }

  .fill {
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 120pt;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .fill.sm { min-width: 60pt; }
  .fill.lg { min-width: 200pt; }

  .pagebreak { page-break-before: always; }

  .acceptance { margin-top: 26pt; }
  .siglines { margin-top: 22pt; }
  .sigline {
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 170pt;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    height: 14pt;
  }

  .signblock { margin-top: 40pt; }
  .signblock .sigimg { height: 60px; display: block; margin-bottom: 2pt; }
  .signblock .name { font-weight: bold; }
  .signblock .ruleShort {
    width: 190pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 1px; margin-bottom: 3pt;
  }

  .ackbox {
    margin-top: 18pt; padding: 8pt 10pt;
    border: 1px solid #000; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ PAGE 1 ============ -->

<!-- Letterhead: supply logo + org details, or delete this block if printing
     on pre-printed letterhead paper. -->
<div class="letterhead">
  {{#if letterheadLogoUrl}}<img src="{{letterheadLogoUrl}}" alt="">{{/if}}
  <div class="org">YOUTH COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT ORGANIZATION (YCDO)</div>
  <div class="meta">{{orgAddress}} &nbsp;|&nbsp; {{orgPhone}} &nbsp;|&nbsp; {{orgEmail}}</div>
</div>
<div class="rule"></div>

<h1 class="title">Selection Letter</h1>

<div class="refrow">
  <span>Letter No.: {{letterNo}}</span>
  <span>Date: {{issueDate}}</span>
</div>

<div class="recipient">
  <div><span class="label">{{salutation}}</span> <span class="fill lg">{{employeeName}}</span></div>
  <div><span class="label">CNIC No.:</span> <span class="fill lg">{{cnic}}</span></div>
  <div><span class="label">Phone:</span> <span class="fill lg">{{phone}}</span></div>
</div>

<p class="noindent"><strong>Assalam o Alaikum!</strong></p>

<p>We&rsquo;re pleased to inform you that you have been selected as a Volunteer for
Medical Services in the <strong>YCDO Group of Hospitals</strong> for charity. YCDO is
unable to pay the salary due to lack of resources but for your patty expenses,
we&rsquo;ll pay stipend Rs. <span class="fill sm">{{stipendAmount}}</span> against
<span class="fill sm">{{hoursPerDay}}</span> Hours per day for
<span class="fill sm">{{shiftName}}</span> shift. Incentives are applicable
depends on your quality of services as given below;</p>

<div class="grades">
  <span>-Poor</span><span>- Satisfactory</span><span>-Good</span><span>-Excellent</span>
</div>

<p>Your First <strong>03 months</strong> will be considered as probationary period.
During your probationary period, <strong>15%</strong> stipend and incentives will not
be paid. Your pending dues will be paid after successful completion of probationary
period, if you failed then it&rsquo;ll be forfeited.</p>

<p>You&rsquo;re appointed as <span class="fill">{{designation}}</span> in the
<span class="fill">{{department}}</span> Department on the capacity of
<span class="fill">{{capacity}}</span> at YCDO Hospital
<span class="fill">{{branchName}}</span> and your working schedule is
<span class="fill sm">{{scheduleFrom}}</span> to
<span class="fill sm">{{scheduleTo}}</span>.</p>

<h2 class="section">Terms &amp; Conditions;</h2>

<ol class="terms">
  <li>You&rsquo;re bound to follow the SOP&rsquo;s of YCDO &amp; directions from the
  Head Office. Also bound to attend the calls and directions from the representatives
  of different department of YCDO.</li>

  <li>You are not allowed to refer the patients of YCDO at your personal clinic or any
  other private hospital and private clinic, except government hospitals/institutions
  if necessary. You are not allowed to present your personal visiting card or phone
  number to any patient at YCDO hospital during services. You&rsquo;re also not allowed
  to meet the medical raps except authorized persons of companies. You&rsquo;re not
  allowed to prescribe the medicine from the medical store except YCDO Pharmacy.</li>

  <!-- ============ PAGE 2 ============ -->
  <li class="pagebreak">You&rsquo;re bound to follow the online Medicine Management
  System, HRMS, Lab Management System, Reception Management System and Surgical
  Management System.</li>

  <li>You&rsquo;ve four Leaves are allowed in a month.</li>

  <li>You&rsquo;ve to give <strong>30 days&rsquo; written notice</strong> for resign or
  separation if you left suddenly then your pending dues will be forfeited. YCDO
  reserves the right to terminate volunteer for misconduct, violation of organizational
  policies, or unsatisfactory performance.</li>

  <li>You&rsquo;re bound to follow the First part of SOP strictly if you failed then
  suspension or termination will be proceed. It&rsquo;s directed you that follow the
  section No. 06, 07,08,10 strictly, if you violate these sections of your job
  description/sop. If you violate these sections then fine will be impose not less
  than Rs. 10,000/-</li>
</ol>

<div class="acceptance">
  <h2 class="section">Acceptance</h2>

  <p>I accept the appointment as <span class="fill lg">{{designation}}</span> with
  <strong>YCDO Group of Hospitals</strong> and agree to abide by all organizational
  rules, policies, and terms of volunteer/selection.</p>

  {{#if digitalAcceptance}}
    <!-- Portal delivery: acknowledgement replaces the wet signature. -->
    <div class="ackbox">
      Accepted electronically by <strong>{{employeeName}}</strong> on
      <strong>{{acceptedAt}}</strong> via the YCDO HRMS Employee Portal.<br>
      Acknowledgement reference: {{acceptanceRef}}
    </div>
  {{else}}
    <!-- Print-and-sign: blanks preserved exactly as the approved format. -->
    <div class="siglines">
      <strong>Name:</strong> <span class="sigline"></span>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
      <strong>Volunteer Signature:</strong> <span class="sigline"></span>
    </div>
  {{/if}}
</div>

<div class="signblock">
  <div class="ruleShort"></div>
  <div>Chairman Admin Department</div>
  <div class="name">Youth Community Development Organization (YCDO)</div>
</div>

<div class="signblock">
  {{#if founderSignatureUrl}}
    <img class="sigimg" src="{{founderSignatureUrl}}" alt="">
  {{/if}}
  <div class="name">Founder/Head of Organization</div>
  <div class="name">YCDO Pakistan</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
